        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet that you can see deals damage to you.</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> You show it the hour of its own death &mdash; not a threat, a <strong>date</strong>. It attempts a Will save against your Stargazer DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> It is unaffected and is temporarily immune for 10 minutes.<br /><strong>Success</strong> Frightened 1.<br /><strong>Failure</strong> Frightened 2.<br /><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Frightened 3 and <strong>stunned 1</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>When something within 30 feet hurts you, a button appears in your whispers.</em></p>"
